# Build-context allowlist for images built from the repo root
# (docker/block-image.Dockerfile and docker/runner-image.Dockerfile): everything is
# excluded except the packages those images install, so local venvs, the
# frontend, backend, git history etc. never reach the docker daemon.
*
!playbook
!playbook-library
!runner
playbook/.venv
playbook-library/.pixi
runner/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
